    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p26_b25",
      "text": "The proof in Section H shows that the DRRO optimizer majorizes the DRO optimizer.\nDRO equalizes exposure because it protects worst-case value; DRRO reallocates mass\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.58,
        411.2,
        525.6,
        441.2
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        286,
        1644,
