      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p26_b29",
      "text": "aggregated. Because Figure 3 shows that all methods can deteriorate after drifting too far\nfrom the initial policy, we compare DRO and DRRO inside a local policy class.\n",
